    "expiry": null,
    "expired": false
  },
  "description": "<p>For an item that places a Sphere template and consumes uses with scaling enabled, these Rave 5e changes increase the template size during use.</p><p>Enable Runtime when the change needs activity-use values such as `@scaling` or `@scaling.increase`.</p><p>`@gridDistance` returns the grid distance of the active scene, allowing formulas such as `@scaling * @gridDistance`.</p><p>To match only sphere templates:<br>{\"path\":\"activity.target.template.type\",\"eq\":\"sphere\"}</p>",
